WEBVTT

00:32:30.205 --> 00:32:32.649
AG: If you're worried
that your career will decline,

00:32:32.673 --> 00:32:34.402
don't let your output decline,

00:32:34.426 --> 00:32:37.205
and don't let your curiosity
stagnate either.

00:32:37.229 --> 00:32:40.784
It's never too late to invent
or to reinvent yourself.

00:32:40.808 --> 00:32:44.394
LW: I think the older you are,
the more valuable you can be.

00:32:44.418 --> 00:32:45.594
AG: I love that

00:32:45.618 --> 00:32:47.579
because I don't ever want to retire.

00:32:47.603 --> 00:32:51.290
(Music)

00:32:51.314 --> 00:32:53.568
Next time on "WorkLife."

00:32:53.592 --> 00:32:55.436
Working remotely is full of challenges

00:32:55.460 --> 00:32:57.284
that have made our work lives harder.

00:32:57.890 --> 00:33:01.379
Lizet Ocampo: So we turn our cameras on
and there I am as something else.